  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.	Providing technical inputs into the three activities with a specific focus on irrigation and WRM: 
2.	Ensuring coordination between the three AWP funded activities:
3.	Leading liaison processes with governments and regional bodies
